1
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:13,330
You were made to be ruled.

2
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:23,900
In the end, it will be every man for himself.

3
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,200
What do we do?

4
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,480
We get ready.

5
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:49,560
There was an idea to bring together a group of remarkable people,

6
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,950
so when we needed

7
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:58,200
them, they could fight the battles that we never could.

8
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:07,930
Gentlemen, what are you prepared to do?

9
00:01:11,690 --> 00:01:13,530
No offense, but I don't play well with others.

10
00:01:13,870 --> 00:01:14,970
Big man in a suit of armor.

11
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:15,830
Take that away.

12
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:16,450
What are you?

13
00:01:16,330 --> 00:01:19,090
A genius billionaire playboy philanthropist.

14
00:01:19,730 --> 00:01:38,050
If we can't protect the Earth, I'm sure we'll avenge it.

15
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:52,700
Dr. Banner, your work is unparalleled, and I'm a huge fan of

16
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:53,700
the way you lose control

17
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,580
and turn into an enormous green rage monster.

18
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,460
Thanks.
